  "question": {
    "text": "Let the sum of the first <math><mi>n</mi></math> terms of a non-constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> be <math><mn>50</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>A</mi></math> is a constant. If <math><mi>d</mi></math> is the common difference of this <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
